  "details": "This occurs seemingly randomly while playing.\n\nI will be running around as usual, then the Pico system keyboard will appear somewhere in my playspace, locking my controls until I close it again. (i.e. I will be stuck moving in one direction)\n\nThis did not occur before the system keyboard button was added to the chatbox. The only possible lead I can give at the moment is that it's related to that change. Maybe something is trying to get keyboard focus in-world? Happened in Prison Escape.\n\nTyping into it and pressing enter doesn't seem to do anything.",
